WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.600
Our heroes experience a breathtaking view of Snowbelle City,

2
00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:13.933
where Ash intends to win his eighth Kalos Gym badge.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.533
Snowbelle City, we're finally here.

4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.133
Yay, snow.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.433
- Bonnie, you'll catch a cold.
- I'm fine, Clemont, don't worry.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.566
Just think. Your eighth Gym badge? It won't be long.

7
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:31.666
Yeah. I'll get it and catch up with Sawyer.

8
00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:36.566
- I know you're right, Ash. I can't wait.
- I wonder if we'll see Ash-Greninja.

9
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:39.700
- What's an Ash-Greninja?
- I've never heard of that.

10
00:00:39.766 --> 00:00:43.000
That's the name I made up for when Greninja's changed.

11
00:00:43.866 --> 00:00:45.400
Great name.

12
00:00:45.466 --> 00:00:47.366
- It does look like Ash.
- Right?

13
00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:50.400
- And you complain about my names?
- It's fine.

14
00:00:51.066 --> 00:00:53.866
Then let's get to the Snowbelle Gym right away.

15
00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:55.933
Eighth Gym badge, here I come.

16
00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:08.066
It looks like that's the Gym.

17
00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:10.966
Yippee! First one there wins a prize.

18
00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:13.633
- Hey, no fair.
- But it's so icy.

19
00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:19.700
Just watch. I'm gonna do it. No doubt I'll get my eighth Gym badge here.

20
00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:24.200
We'll battle at the Kalos League. I'm gonna break my losing streak.

21
00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:27.733
And then you and I will even the score.

22
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.433
Yeah. You're on, Ash.

23
00:01:32.366 --> 00:01:34.666
- Ash, Sawyer.
- Huh?

24
00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.400
Hurry up. Don't get left behind.

25
00:01:37.966 --> 00:01:38.866
Hurry.

26
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.233
- Come on.
- Okay.

27
00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.066
I'd like to have a Gym battle, please.

28
00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.100
Look at the Pokémon.

29
00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:51.300
Bergmite, the Ice Chunk Pokémon. Bergmite's body is covered with ice,

30
00:02:51.366 --> 00:02:55.100
used to protect against opponents. Cracks are fixed with cold air.

31
00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:57.233
- Wow!
- Are they greeting us?

32
00:02:59.566 --> 00:03:01.666
Welcome to the Snowbelle Gym.

33
00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:06.700
It's very cold inside the Gym, so please make any necessary preparations.

34
00:03:06.766 --> 00:03:09.066
So, it's freezing inside and out.

35
00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:12.700
I'm sure glad I borrowed this from the Pokémon Center.

36
00:03:12.766 --> 00:03:14.533
We're ready to come inside.

37
00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:17.033
Excellent. Please enter.

38
00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:38.200
Attention. Hello, there. Welcome to my Gym.

39
00:03:39.266 --> 00:03:41.666
I'd like to have a Gym battle, please.

40
00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.700
Hm. Very well.

41
00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:47.200
I'm Wulfric. You see, I'm the Snowbelle Gym Leader.

42
00:03:47.266 --> 00:03:50.433
Don't you get cold sitting on the ice like that?

43
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.166
When you get to the point where I'm at,

44
00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:57.100
you can feel a heated heart even sitting on ice.

45
00:03:57.166 --> 00:04:00.100
So, being here is absolutely comfortable for me.

46
00:04:00.166 --> 00:04:03.000
Oh! I remember you from before.

47
00:04:03.633 --> 00:04:07.000
Right. I challenged you to a Gym battle.

48
00:04:07.466 --> 00:04:08.800
I recall our battle.

49
00:04:08.866 --> 00:04:10.966
Ha! Quite heated, indeed.

50
00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.233
Thank you so much.

51
00:04:14.266 --> 00:04:16.066
Who challenges me now?

52
00:04:16.533 --> 00:04:19.066
My name is Ash Ketchum, from Pallet Town.

53
00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:20.433
Pikachu!

54
00:04:20.899 --> 00:04:23.033
- Number of badges so far?
- Seven.

55
00:04:23.566 --> 00:04:24.533
I see.

56
00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:29.166
So, you're going for your final badge? Enjoy the experience.

57
00:04:29.933 --> 00:04:31.000
Right.

58
00:04:31.666 --> 00:04:32.666
Here. Hold this.

59
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.300
- I'm getting really heated up.
- Pika!

60
00:04:41.733 --> 00:04:45.566
All right. The Snowbelle City Gym battle is about to begin.

61
00:04:45.633 --> 00:04:47.766
Each side will use three Pokémon,

62
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:52.966
and the battle will be over when all three of one's Pokémon are unable to continue.

63
00:04:53.033 --> 00:04:57.633
Only the challenger will be allowed to make substitutions during the battle.

64
00:04:59.033 --> 00:05:03.633
You know what? Ice is extremely hard and fragile at the same time.

65
00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:08.166
So, depending on what Pokémon you choose and their moves,

66
00:05:08.233 --> 00:05:12.400
I could be your most challenging opponent yet, or a total pushover...

67
00:05:12.766 --> 00:05:14.633
which is as it should be.

68
00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.366
But enough of all this rambling.

69
00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:20.833
- Let's get this show on the road.
- Right.

70
00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.400
Now, Hawlucha. I choose you.

71
00:05:27.866 --> 00:05:30.766
Careful. We're on an ice battlefield today.

72
00:05:31.966 --> 00:05:33.900
Go, Abomasnow.

73
00:05:43.933 --> 00:05:45.300
- Pika?
- Huh?

74
00:05:45.366 --> 00:05:47.500
- It's hail.
- This could be bad.

75
00:05:52.533 --> 00:05:55.500
You know what? You're seeing Abomasnow's ability.

76
00:05:55.966 --> 00:06:00.400
Abomasnow's ability is able to make hail fall on the entire battlefield.

77
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:03.633
And that hail can cause a great deal of damage.

78
00:06:04.133 --> 00:06:08.400
Bring it on, Abomasnow. Hawlucha, full throttle right off the bat.

79
00:06:09.533 --> 00:06:10.966
Use Flying Press.

80
00:06:19.966 --> 00:06:22.266
Ah. Most impressive power.

81
00:06:25.066 --> 00:06:28.466
- It's taking damage from the hail.
- Now, High Jump Kick.

82
00:06:32.533 --> 00:06:34.600
Ice Shard, let's go.

83
00:06:43.566 --> 00:06:44.600
Wood Hammer.

84
00:06:50.133 --> 00:06:52.000
Dodge it and use Flying Press.

85
00:07:02.133 --> 00:07:04.800
We're just getting started. High Jump Kick.

86
00:07:23.366 --> 00:07:25.900
Abomasnow is unable to battle.

87
00:07:25.966 --> 00:07:27.433
Hawlucha is the winner.

88
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.866
Yeah. Way to go.

89
00:07:30.366 --> 00:07:32.933
- They won.
- Hawlucha's so awesome. Yay!

90
00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.900
That speed was classic Ash.

91
00:07:34.966 --> 00:07:36.733
He pulled out all the stops.

92
00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.800
Sure. It's his final badge.

93
00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.666
Abomasnow, you battled well.

94
00:07:44.466 --> 00:07:46.666
You really showed them how to do it.

95
00:07:48.666 --> 00:07:51.033
Now... your turn.

96
00:07:53.433 --> 00:07:54.733
Avalugg!

97
00:07:55.766 --> 00:07:57.266
Here we go, Avalugg.

98
00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:03.700
It's huge.

99
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.166
Avalugg, the Iceberg Pokémon and the evolved form of Bergmite.

100
00:08:11.233 --> 00:08:14.000
Avalugg's ice-covered body is hard as steel.

101
00:08:14.066 --> 00:08:17.566
It uses its body to demolish any obstacle in its way.

102
00:08:17.633 --> 00:08:20.500
Let's wrap this up quick. Karate Chop, let's go.

103
00:08:21.366 --> 00:08:23.266
Now, Stone Edge.

104
00:08:36.666 --> 00:08:37.933
- Oh!
- Huh?

105
00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.433
Its ability is Ice Body.

106
00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:45.233
You see, when hail is falling, any damage it takes is slowly healed.

107
00:08:45.666 --> 00:08:47.466
Slowly healed?

108
00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.966
I see. So, that's why Wulfric used Abomasnow first.

109
00:08:51.033 --> 00:08:52.966
Keep it up. High Jump Kick.

110
00:08:56.166 --> 00:08:57.133
Gyro Ball.

111
00:09:04.133 --> 00:09:05.400
It got knocked back.

112
00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.933
Keep the heat on with Flying Press.

113
00:09:18.366 --> 00:09:19.333
Hawlucha, no.

114
00:09:23.866 --> 00:09:25.933
Hawlucha is unable to battle.

115
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.366
Avalugg is the winner.

116
00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:28.633
Oh, no.

117
00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.866
The hail really worked.

118
00:09:30.933 --> 00:09:33.666
- So, now it's one to one.
- Yup. Even.

119
00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.433
Hawlucha, you were awesome. Thanks.

120
00:09:44.966 --> 00:09:46.733
All right, Talonflame...

121
00:09:48.133 --> 00:09:49.066
I choose you.

122
00:09:51.766 --> 00:09:52.733
Flame!

123
00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.733
Okay, Talonflame, make sure you watch out for that hail.

124
00:09:57.866 --> 00:09:59.133
Use Flame Charge, go.

125
00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.666
All right. That was a great hit.

126
00:10:05.733 --> 00:10:07.900
Super-effective. What a hit.

127
00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:14.933
- Avalugg's still healing.
- This could still go either way.

128
00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:17.433
Pika!

129
00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.266
Use Avalanche.

130
00:10:20.766 --> 00:10:21.600
Heads up.

131
00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.866
- No, Talonflame.
- Pika!

132
00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.866
Talonflame.

133
00:10:30.933 --> 00:10:32.966
Talonflame, you okay?

134
00:10:35.066 --> 00:10:38.733
- What power.
- You see, Avalanche becomes more powerful

135
00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.566
when used against a Pokémon that attacked the user.

136
00:10:41.633 --> 00:10:44.400
So, even if Ash is faster than his opponent...

137
00:10:44.766 --> 00:10:48.700
- Wulfric will use that speed against him.
- Get up, Talonflame.

138
00:10:50.766 --> 00:10:52.500
Avalugg, Stone Edge.

139
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.433
Dodge it.

140
00:10:57.633 --> 00:10:58.766
Way to go.

141
00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:02.366
As things are, Ash has to be very careful when he attacks.

142
00:11:02.633 --> 00:11:07.600
- Or Wulfric will counter with Avalanche.
- But we can't win unless we attack.

143
00:11:09.066 --> 00:11:11.066
Talonflame, use Flame Charge.

144
00:11:15.133 --> 00:11:16.000
Use Avalanche.

145
00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.833
Talonflame!

146
00:11:26.133 --> 00:11:30.333
Talonflame is unable to battle, so Avalugg is the winner.

147
00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.366
Avalugg is so strong.

148
00:11:36.466 --> 00:11:39.366
What can Ash do? How can he beat Avalanche?

149
00:11:39.433 --> 00:11:41.766
And Ash only has one Pokémon left.

150
00:11:43.466 --> 00:11:45.866
Thanks, Talonflame. Take a good rest.

151
00:11:48.666 --> 00:11:51.300
Now, Greninja, I choose you.

152
00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.433
Who's that Pokémon?

153
00:12:04.033 --> 00:12:05.866
It's Bergmite.

154
00:12:05.933 --> 00:12:07.533
Bergmite. Berg, Berg.

155
00:12:11.166 --> 00:12:12.800
Greninja's his last chance.

156
00:12:13.133 --> 00:12:16.800
This tension. If Ash could just use that energy...

157
00:12:16.866 --> 00:12:19.266
Then it'll transform into Ash-Greninja.

158
00:12:20.766 --> 00:12:23.333
Try not to worry about the hail, Greninja.

159
00:12:24.466 --> 00:12:26.533
All right. Use Cut.

160
00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:31.866
Use Stone Edge.

161
00:12:40.566 --> 00:12:43.900
- Well...
- We're still in this. Use Aerial Ace.

162
00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.166
Now, Gyro Ball.

163
00:12:56.633 --> 00:12:58.366
See what you think of this.

164
00:12:58.433 --> 00:13:00.900
Greninja, Water Shuriken over and over.

165
00:13:06.966 --> 00:13:07.933
Useless.

166
00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.000
I already told them once. Huh?

167
00:13:19.066 --> 00:13:20.400
What? What's this?

168
00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:22.466
All right. Cut. Let's go.

169
00:13:31.433 --> 00:13:34.500
- Yippee.
- Hey, what just happened, Clemont?

170
00:13:34.933 --> 00:13:37.866
When the water from Greninja's Water Shuriken

171
00:13:37.933 --> 00:13:40.300
hit Avalugg's body, it froze.

172
00:13:40.366 --> 00:13:42.866
- Wow.
- So, it couldn't move.

173
00:13:46.833 --> 00:13:49.766
I must say, I'm quite surprised.

174
00:13:49.833 --> 00:13:54.000
Way to go. What do you say we give them a little taste of our power?

175
00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.266
More. Stronger and stronger.

176
00:14:05.866 --> 00:14:07.600
Here it comes.

177
00:14:07.666 --> 00:14:09.500
Ash-Greninja!

178
00:14:09.566 --> 00:14:10.800
What's Ash-Greninja?

179
00:14:10.866 --> 00:14:13.733
Wait, I know I've seen it look this way before.

180
00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.133
Okay, let's do this.

181
00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.233
Use Aerial Ace.

182
00:14:30.566 --> 00:14:31.833
Speedy.

183
00:14:33.033 --> 00:14:34.300
Use Avalanche.

184
00:14:42.533 --> 00:14:46.100
It looks like when Greninja takes a hit, Ash feels it, too.

185
00:14:46.166 --> 00:14:48.500
- Is that possible?
- Of course it is.

186
00:14:48.566 --> 00:14:51.133
By now, they're in total synchronization.

187
00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.300
You can do it, Greninja. Win it.

188
00:14:54.133 --> 00:14:54.966
Ash.

189
00:14:56.666 --> 00:14:57.733
I wanna win.

190
00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.500
This is the battle of all battles.

191
00:15:02.066 --> 00:15:03.300
I've gotta win.

192
00:15:06.033 --> 00:15:08.633
Greninja, use Cut.

193
00:15:11.033 --> 00:15:13.000
Avalugg, use Stone Edge.

194
00:15:24.133 --> 00:15:25.166
Stone Edge again.

195
00:15:30.633 --> 00:15:32.600
Greninja!

196
00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.833
You're all right. Quick, Aerial Ace.

197
00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.966
Ah. Incredible power.

198
00:15:52.066 --> 00:15:54.866
Even so, use Avalanche!

199
00:15:59.133 --> 00:16:00.166
Greninja!

200
00:16:05.233 --> 00:16:07.400
Stronger. Stronger.

201
00:16:08.033 --> 00:16:10.366
All right, Greninja, Cut, let's go.

202
00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.166
Use Ice Fang.

203
00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:22.433
Now, Gyro Ball.

204
00:16:29.333 --> 00:16:30.366
Greninja!

205
00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.266
Pika!

206
00:16:44.633 --> 00:16:47.033
Greninja is unable to battle.

207
00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.733
Avalugg is the winner.

208
00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:52.366
And that means the match goes to the Gym Leader, Wulfric.

209
00:16:52.666 --> 00:16:54.366
Pika. Pika!

210
00:16:59.466 --> 00:17:01.900
Pikachu, does that mean I lost?

211
00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:03.433
Pika.

212
00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.433
I hope you learned something.

213
00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.366
Being rigid can make you tough but fragile, too.

214
00:17:08.433 --> 00:17:10.433
You're better off being flexible.

215
00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.933
Some adapt like water without changing, but I'm stubborn. I love Ice Types.

216
00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:18.500
- So, what about you, young man?
- Huh?

217
00:17:21.366 --> 00:17:25.733
How far you go depends on how much you believe in your Pokémon.

218
00:17:26.933 --> 00:17:30.566
The fact is, you haven't earned your badge quite yet.

219
00:17:48.733 --> 00:17:49.766
How is Greninja?

220
00:17:49.833 --> 00:17:53.300
Your Greninja has taken a substantial amount of damage.

221
00:17:53.733 --> 00:17:55.800
But it'll be fine. I'll make sure of it.

222
00:18:06.033 --> 00:18:07.833
- You're leaving now?
- Yeah.

223
00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:11.633
I need to get my Pokémon all ready to go for the Kalos League.

224
00:18:13.166 --> 00:18:15.900
Bye, Ash. I'll be waiting for you.

225
00:18:16.666 --> 00:18:17.533
Yeah.

226
00:18:23.766 --> 00:18:25.266
Okay, then, everybody,

227
00:18:25.333 --> 00:18:27.133
- see you around.
- Bye-bye.

228
00:18:28.333 --> 00:18:29.533
You take care.

229
00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:35.066
It's all gonna work out.

230
00:18:35.666 --> 00:18:38.566
The person I admire so much will win in the end.

231
00:18:40.233 --> 00:18:41.466
And I'll be waiting.

232
00:18:42.933 --> 00:18:43.900
I'll be waiting.

233
00:18:44.666 --> 00:18:47.266
Bye, Ash. See you in the Kalos League.

234
00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:02.200
Sorry about today, Greninja. If I had just been stronger...

235
00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:07.166
I should've been able to draw out your true power.

236
00:19:08.033 --> 00:19:10.100
If only I was stronger...

237
00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:14.633
- Huh?
- Huh?

238
00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.133
Ash.

239
00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.133
Pika, Pika?

240
00:19:27.266 --> 00:19:29.600
- I wanna be by myself.
- Pika.

241
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.733
- Out in the cold at this time of night?
- It's okay. I'll be back soon.

242
00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:36.366
Sorry, Pikachu.

243
00:20:01.266 --> 00:20:03.600
He still hasn't come back yet.

244
00:20:03.666 --> 00:20:04.533
Yeah.

245
00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.033
But there's nothing we can do about it.

246
00:20:07.366 --> 00:20:08.266
Good morning.

247
00:20:10.166 --> 00:20:11.400
Hey, where's Ash?

248
00:20:12.733 --> 00:20:15.666
Ash-- He needed to be alone for a bit.

249
00:20:16.033 --> 00:20:17.033
Don't worry.

250
00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:20.900
He'll get hungry and come back when it gets close to lunchtime.

251
00:20:27.266 --> 00:20:28.200
Ash.

252
00:20:32.266 --> 00:20:34.833
After losing his Snowbelle City Gym battle,

253
00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:37.533
Ash is off by himself, looking for answers.

254
00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.466
How will he handle the situation he now finds himself in?

255
00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.666
The answers to come as the journey continues.
